    "title": "Sheriff's Office investigates shooting - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Special to the News-Standard ,\n10 hours ago The Trinity County Sheriff’s Office received multiple 911 calls regarding a serious incident near the Neches River Bridge. A passerby contacted 911 after noticing a child in the roadway attempting to flag down motorists for help. Shortly after, additional information was received indicating a shooting had occurred in the same area. Deputies with the Trinity County Sheriff’s Office and troopers with the Texas Department of Public Safety responded immediately. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
